<title>USA: Omaha cattle active-up $2.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle active-up $2.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said slaughter steers and heifers were active, $2.00 higher.</p>
<p>Steers:  Select to Choice 2-4, 1100-1300 lbs 67.00-68.50.</p>
<p>Heifers: Select and Choice 2-4, 950-1250 lbs 66.50-68.00, mostly Choice 68.50.</p>
</text>
